---
/**
 * Curtain over the canvas and section backgrounds only (z 18 < copy z 20),
 * so the headline is readable — and LCP lands — before WebGL is ready.
 * The counter shows real load progress, then the curtain wipes up to reveal
 * the hero as the campus model starts to build.
 */
---

<div id="preloader" class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-[18] bg-[#f3f5f8]" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="gutter absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between pb-[max(1.25rem,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]">
    <span class="label text-ink/50" data-pre-label>Building the model</span>
    <span class="font-mono text-[clamp(2.5rem,7vw,4.5rem)] leading-[0.8] tracking-tighter text-ink tabular-nums" data-pre-count>000</span>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 bg-gold" data-pre-bar></div>
</div>
